
######## 23:53:16 ldp-1: LDP の疑似回線で同じ形を作る(VLAN 160)。XE1= PW 161・XE2= PW 162 で XE3 へ。XE3 は XE1 を主・XE2 を予備
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
XE1(config)#
interface Port-channel1
XE1(config-if)#
service instance 160 ethernet
XE1(config-if-srv)#
encapsulation dot1q 160
XE1(config-if-srv)#
rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
XE1(config-if-srv)#
exit
XE1(config-if)#
exit
XE1(config)#
l2vpn xconnect context SITE4-SITE3-LDP
XE1(config-xconnect)#
member Port-channel1 service-instance 160
XE1(config-xconnect)#
member 10.255.0.43 161 encapsulation mpls
XE1(config-xconnect)#
end
XE1#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
XE2(config)#
interface Port-channel1
XE2(config-if)#
service instance 160 ethernet
XE2(config-if-srv)#
encapsulation dot1q 160
XE2(config-if-srv)#
rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
XE2(config-if-srv)#
exit
XE2(config-if)#
exit
XE2(config)#
l2vpn xconnect context SITE4-SITE3-LDP
XE2(config-xconnect)#
member Port-channel1 service-instance 160
XE2(config-xconnect)#
member 10.255.0.43 162 encapsulation mpls
XE2(config-xconnect)#
end
XE2#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
XE3(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet2
XE3(config-if)#
service instance 160 ethernet
XE3(config-if-srv)#
encapsulation dot1q 160
XE3(config-if-srv)#
rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
XE3(config-if-srv)#
exit
XE3(config-if)#
exit
XE3(config)#
l2vpn xconnect context SITE3-SITE4-LDP
XE3(config-xconnect)#
member GigabitEthernet2 service-instance 160
XE3(config-xconnect)#
member 10.255.0.41 161 encapsulation mpls group SITE4 priority 1
XE3(config-xconnect)#
member 10.255.0.42 162 encapsulation mpls group SITE4 priority 2
XE3(config-xconnect)#
end
XE3#
show running-config | section xconnect
l2vpn xconnect context SITE3-SITE4-LDP
 member GigabitEthernet2 service-instance 160 
 member 10.255.0.41 161 encapsulation mpls group SITE4 priority 1
 member 10.255.0.42 162 encapsulation mpls group SITE4 priority 2
XE3#

